Permissions:
  Run catalog tool "public-grep"

Ask "Which catalog request?" as tool_request
Run catalog tool tool_request as tool_result
result_shape equals record with "number" as exit_code and "text" as stdout and "text" as stderr
Require tool_result matches shape result_shape otherwise fail with "Invalid public search result."
Require count of keys of tool_result equals 3 otherwise fail with "Invalid public search result."
Require exit_code of tool_result equals 0 otherwise fail with "Public search did not complete successfully."
Respond with "Approved public search completed."
